{"last_link_id": 308, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#ffffff", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["### 📘 课程目标\n- 体验 **1–4 步快速出图** 的极速流程；\n- 对比少步采样下的画质与可控性；\n- 理解 **蒸馏/一致性** 家族在实时预览/视频帧/批量打样中的优势与边界。\n\n**适用场景**：脚本/提示词打样、视频生成中间帧、A/B 快速比较。\n\n**推荐参数**：Steps 4–8，CFG 1–3（低 CFG 更稳），分辨率 ≤ 768。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#5b8740", "size": [740, 220], "pos": [-1544.5849609375, -781.6472778320312], "id": 2, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#ffffff", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["### 📞 联系方式 & 课程资源\n**交流 +V：starsfoster**  \n[🔗 点击注册 RunningHub 领取500RH币](https://www.runninghub.cn/?inviteCode=efmilbvz)\n\n> 提示：如加载时报找不到权重，请在 **CheckpointLoader** 手动选择你本地的 SDXL-Turbo 模型文件。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#c9852f", "size": [790, 220], "pos": [-778.5848999023438, -781.6472778320312], "id": 3, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "slot_index": 1, "links": [], "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [320, 360], "pos": [-1548, -382], "widgets_values": ["cb0f4862608a5c8408d5745af676c851074dfae0399e597d8b69b7a1427c3c1d.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Load Image (WeChat QR)"}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# comfyui从入门到躺平 · 第5课（D1）——SDXL-Turbo 快速预览（Turbo Few-Step Flow）"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [1560, 110], "pos": [-1546.5849609375, -921.6472778320312], "id": 1, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#ffffff", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["### ⚠️ 兼容性提示\n- 本工程默认 `sdxl_turbo_1.0_fp16.safetensors`。若本地无此文件，请在 **CheckpointLoader** 中选择你已有的 SDXL-Turbo 模型；\n- 其他节点为 ComfyUI 内置，安装即用。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#c9852f", "size": [1560, 100], "pos": [-1456.8529052734375, 1247.69091796875], "id": 22, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#ffffff", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["### ✅ 节点结构（本课）\n**CheckpointLoader (SDXL-Turbo) → (CLIPTextEncode± → KSampler[Few-Step]) → VAEDecode → SaveImage**"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#2e6b6b", "size": [1560, 120], "pos": [-1459.4185791015625, 1099.4407958984375], "id": 21, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#ffffff", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["### 🧪 实操建议\n1) 先用 **steps=4/CFG=1.5** 快速预览；\n2) 若主体漂：提高 steps=6–8 或略升 CFG；\n3) 若细节糊：补充更清晰的主体/材质描述；\n4) 需要高画质：换回 SDXL Base + Refiner 或增加步数（非 Turbo）。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#5b8740", "size": [1560, 120], "pos": [-1461.984619140625, 942.6378784179688], "id": 20, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#ffffff", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["#### 🧩 CheckpointLoader（SDXL-Turbo）\n- 加载 **SDXL-Turbo** 蒸馏模型；\n- 输出 **MODEL/CLIP/VAE** 到下游；\n- 少步采样专用权重，匹配低步数（1–4）也能成图。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#2e6b6b", "size": [630, 160], "pos": [-1205.40771484375, -421.3421630859375], "id": 5, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#ffffff", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["### 📎 教学要点回顾（速记）\n- **少步采样 ≠ 万能画质**：高速换来细节与构图的部分妥协；\n- **低 CFG 更稳**：1–3 区间更贴 prompt 语义，不易过锐/伪影；\n- **适配视频帧/实时交互**：适合中间帧/打样/快速 A/B；\n- 需要最终画质→可在下游接 Refiner 或切换非蒸馏大步数流程。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#354d73", "size": [1560, 150], "pos": [-1463.695556640625, 759.5460815429688], "id": 19, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#ffffff", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["#### 💾 SaveImage（导出）\n- 导出最终图像到右侧结果面板；\n- 可设置文件前缀/路径；\n- 课堂演示：对比不同 steps/CFG 的输出差异。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#2e6b6b", "size": [420, 140], "pos": [1213.0657958984375, -204.4163818359375], "id": 17, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [220, 270], "pos": [1229.002197265625, 21.639646530151367], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI_SDXL_Turbo"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 308, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}], "flags": {}, "id": 18, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 21}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [308], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}], "size": [250, 100], "pos": [785.0790405273438, 1.1492877006530762], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 306, "label": "samples", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "samples"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 307, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {}, "id": 16, "type": "VAEDecode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecode"}, "order": 20}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#ffffff", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["#### 🔄 VAEDecode（解码）\n- 将潜空间样本解码为像素图；\n- 使用与加载一致的 VAE 以保持风格。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#2e6b6b", "size": [440, 150], "pos": [728.1618652343